cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file, and cite the references below for the methods it uses."
type: software
title: "PCCMA Atlas image profiling"
abstract: >-
  Image analysis and image-based profiling workflows to extract morphology profiles from the
  Pediatric Cancer Cell Morphology Atlas (PCCMA) dataset, a Cell Painting dataset of 56 cell lines
  imaged at three time points. The workflows include image quality control, illumination correction,
  CellProfiler segmentation and feature extraction, single-cell quality control with coSMicQC, profile processing
  with pycytominer, and nucleocentric deep learning features with MorphEm.
